🟠 api in shop (prod-eu-1) keeps running out of memory. Its memory stayed near 510Mi for four hours before the kill. In the last 5h, all the history kwatch has, its memory peaked at 510Mi (limit 512Mi, request 128Mi); it was near the limit in 4 of those hours, so how much more it needs is not known. Fix: raise the memory limit of container app in deployment/api above 512Mi. To read the output of the last crash, run kubectl logs deploy/api -c app -n shop --previous
